    "name": "TD Bank Token Tokens API",
    "description": "OAuth 2.0 Token API with Pushed Authorization Request (PAR). Issues access tokens for the FDX Data APIs and the Consent API. The flow: POST /par returns a request_uri; build the consent URL with it and send the user to authorize; exchange the resulting authorization code for an access token via POST /token.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: TD Open Banking Developer Support",
